{"reason": "Using completing the square: a²+ab+b²-3a-3b = (a+b/2-3/2)² + (3/4)(b-1)² - 3. Both squares are nonnegative, so the minimum is -3, achieved at a=1, b=1.", "abstain": false, "answer": "-3"}
```

